"""Idea Foundry: a local idea-to-app workbench."""

__version__ = "0.35.0"

__release_notes__ = "Feature-by-feature planning: explicitly choose Plan feature by feature to validate and checkpoint one feature's acceptance evidence per call before task compilation. The controller assigns feature references; packets preserve the idea, revision, fixed scope and approved baseline while disclosing omitted stale draft/source fields. Each validated prefix resumes without replay; complete outline and proposal review remain mandatory. Existing planning modes remain available. The local planning timeout menu now defaults to two minutes, still honoring explicit choices. Diag and Dashboard show saved acceptance progress. A larger 192px emblem has taller blue/cyan flame contours, soft bloom and white-hot detail; pause, background visibility and reduced-motion controls stop SVG and CSS motion together. Source, approval, frozen checks, consent, output gates and bounded attempts remain protected. Live-model quality, costs and Windows GPU performance remain untested."
